  {
   "id": "bombanana-404342@major-2026-10-24",
   "gameId": "bombanana-404342",
   "displayName": "Halloween Environments & Costume Update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-24T21:34:52.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🎃 Greetings Monkeys! 🙉🙊🙈🎃",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spooky season has officially landed, the fog is rolling in, and the bananas are getting... a little haunted! 🍂👻",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Our dev monkeys have been lurking in the shadows, brewing up a frightfully fun surprise for everyone. To celebrate the spooky season with our favorite bomb diffusers, we are thrilled to drop our Halloween Content Update! 🎃💥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "⚠️ WHAT’S INCLUDED IN THIS UPDATE ⚠️",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "🦇 Spooky Halloween Environment & Atmosphere: We’ve redecorated the environment with Halloween props, eerie decor and thick, rolling autumn fog! Defusing bombs just got a whole lot spookier and a lot more chaotic.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46130201/9fcb790042254bfb6e61ebfe9192e0e57d5a5b4f.jpg\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46130201/6bfeedfb656a6d3f41c6b0f138c04378c2bf1d97.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🧙 New Player Costumes: Express your inner monkey with a fresh set of Halloween player costumes! Grab your new look and defuse (or explode) in style.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46130201/f041c5632e025b960e4f15bb826fadc2e533e74f.jpg\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46130201/a34110b87353b547fe9229c3d40e4f51ef83bf50.jpg\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46130201/b77e41adcdf32f021d4fe17cb39d8c1ce403c248.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gather your squad, throw on your new outfits, and dive headfirst into the spooky fog! It's time to panic, accuse each other of cutting the wrong wires, and turn every peaceful defusal run into pure Halloween hysteria! 🎃💥",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay spooky, monkeys! 🍌🎃👻",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
