  {
   "id": "bombanana-404342@major-2026-10-09",
   "gameId": "bombanana-404342",
   "displayName": "MAYDAY Update! 💣🚨",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-10-09T11:13:06.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings Monkeys,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the early days of this spooky season, it is time for us to gather once again. 🐒🐒🐒🍂",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Since surpassing 1.5 million players and 3,500 reviews on Steam with an Overwhelmingly Positive rating, our devs have been cooking up something special for you all. We want to celebrate this success with our fellow diffusers and bring you this first major content update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "⚠️WHICH WILL INCLUDE THE FOLLOWING ⚠️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Environments: A brand-new location complete with new hazards, interactions, and chaotic obstacles to navigate",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Expanded Customization: Express your inner monkey with a whole range of new player customization options",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay Refinements & Enhancements: General balance tweaks and feature improvements to keep every defusal run chaotic, fresh, and fun",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46130201/96009a05331c701f8687d0cfc40f7bc57fa0efd4.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46130201/dae47669473a675340b6f1454d5c895ba12a99a1.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's the perfect time to bundle up with your friends, hop on a cozy bomb diffusal run and scream into each other's ears in the hopes of avoiding full blast off.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stay frosty monkeys!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\\[Discord]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
